{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUNS&amp;SODAS</strong> is a fast-paced arcade rogue-action game where explosive sodas and relentless gunfire mix into a high-octane experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the <strong>Five Primal Sodas</strong> \u2014 the base ingredients of every drink ever made \u2014 have been stolen, only you, the Chosen Can Hero, can bring them back. Get ready to face waves of armed enemies, dynamic environments, and unleash the full power of the legendary <strong>Vending Machines</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY EVERYTHING BY DOING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/1195fdc22ae3501315b90d0cb52e95a1.poster.avif?t=1755175150\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/1195fdc22ae3501315b90d0cb52e95a1.webm?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/1195fdc22ae3501315b90d0cb52e95a1.mp4?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super shot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/a432b67f7ec479753d0f63be75f865d6.poster.avif?t=1755175150\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/a432b67f7ec479753d0f63be75f865d6.webm?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/a432b67f7ec479753d0f63be75f865d6.mp4?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/6a7406efc3a7f20a2b1bbcb0539e9395.poster.avif?t=1755175150\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/6a7406efc3a7f20a2b1bbcb0539e9395.webm?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/extras/6a7406efc3a7f20a2b1bbcb0539e9395.mp4?t=1755175150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Stylish, high-speed arcade action:</strong> Dash, shoot, and chain combos in a fast and fluid combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Rogue-lite mechanics: </strong>Start each run from scratch, but as your skills improve, you\u2019ll earn higher scores to unlock <strong>better gear and alternate paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Super Dash: </strong>Dodge enemy fire with fast-paced, acrobatic moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Vending Machines as allies:</strong> Activate and upgrade VMs to gain rear cover. Some drop powerful <strong>gadgets</strong> that trigger your <strong>Super Shot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Tons of guns: </strong>Discover a wild arsenal of pistols, each with its own unique mechanics and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Combo system:</strong> Chain kills to boost efficiency and increase your final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Single Player</strong> \u2013 Perfect for both quick sessions and full-blown marathon runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Endless replayability</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Adapt, improve, and go further each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813550?t=1755175150","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813550?t=1755175150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/483589b8ba16e908d217039235b2c55502778174/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755175150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813550/483589b8ba16e908d217039235b2c55502778174/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755175150","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3832750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUNS&amp;SODAS</strong> is a fast-paced arcade rogue-action game where explosive sodas and relentless gunfire mix into a high-octane experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the <strong>Five Primal Sodas</strong> \u2014 the base ingredients of every drink ever made \u2014 have been stolen, only you, the Chosen Can Hero, can bring them back. Get ready to face waves of armed enemies, dynamic environments, and unleash the full power of the legendary <strong>Vending Machines</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DESTROY EVERYTHING BY DOING:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash</p><p class=